      <p>Free surprise literary keepsake with any <strong>Blind Date with a Book</strong> gift box.</p>
      <a href="https://bizibees-store.myshopify.com/products/blind-date-book-mystery?discount=BEEVIPBOOK" class="btn-claim-reward" target="_blank">
        Explore Vintage Gifts &rarr;
      </a>
      <span class="code-copy">Code: <code>BEEVIPBOOK</code></span>
